cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CeLLMan, please cite it as below."
title: "CeLLMan: AI agentic cell-type annotation on a gene knowledge graph, with segmentation-free spatial mapping"
abstract: >-
  CeLLMan replaces manual cluster labeling with an agentic annotator: an LLM reasons
  against a curated Cell-Ontology knowledge graph (celltype to marker genes, hierarchy,
  confusion pairs, negative markers), applying one explicit identity test per cluster and
  refusing to force-fit unsupported labels. It ships with a segmentation-free, multi-platform
  spatial cell-type mapping workflow (cellman.spatial).
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/<ORG>/CeLLMan"
